tag example;

/* Stashing new into a global requires noregion. */
g: ?*int = null;

stash() {
    g = new int[1](0)
}

main(): int {
    stash();
    0
}

/* expect compile {|
immheapmiss.l8:7:9

    g = new int[1](0)
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^

stash stores this allocation in global g, which can outlive its region.

For retained storage, declare stash and its callers as noregion
(unavailable inside regions), or keep temporary data local to its
region.

Callers also needing noregion: main.

|} */
